  "description": "Makita DHP489Z 18V Brushless Hammer Drill Driver - Distributed/Packaged by Makita. Product Details: Makita DHP489Z 18V Brushless Hammer Drill Driver is a high-performance tool designed for the toughest job sites. Delivering up to 970 in. Lbs of Max Torque, its purpose-built brushless motor ensures exceptional power and efficiency. With a compact and ergonomic design measuring only 6-7/8” in length, this drill offers superior handling and ease of use. Its 2-speed transmission (0-550 and 0-1, 800 RPM) allows for versatile applications including drilling, fastening and hammer drilling. The all-metal keyless chuck and gear housing provide durable and efficient power transmission, while the mechanical 2-speed gearing adapts to both light and heavy-duty tasks. Additional features include a built-in twin LED light with pre-glow and afterglow functions to illuminate your work area and a convenient 13 mm (1/2\") keyless chuck for quick bit changes. The drill offers 21 clutch settings and a drill mode for precise fastening control, along with an electric brake for maximum productivity. A durable, reversible belt clip offers convenient temporary tool storage and Extreme Protection Technology (XPT) ensures improved dust and water resistance for operation in harsh conditions. The battery protection circuit guards against overloading, over-discharging and overheating, ensuring longevity and reliability. The drill includes a 1/2\" keyless drill chuck, a double-ended bit and a hook for added convenience.",
